            "eyebrow": "Our Story",
            "heading": "Bringing Scripture to life",
            "text": "Vision of the Bible is devoted to bringing the timeless stories and profound truths of the Bible to life. Through innovative digital experiences and stunning visual storytelling, we set out to inspire people and draw them close to the Word of God — not to sell a device, but to open a door.",
